  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "マクシオン軍の新EXAMACS「アチェルビー」シリーズに新規造形のブレードを携えた「TYPE-E」が登場！",
      "en": "\"TYPE-E \" with a newly shaped blade is now available in Maxion's new EXAMACS \" Achelby\" series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 素体となる本体のほか、アーマーパーツ、武器パーツがひとつになったオールインワンアイテム。",
      "en": "• An all-in-one item that includes the main body, armor parts, and weapon parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肩や腰に接続可能なアーマーが2種付属。",
      "en": "• Two types of armor that can be connected to the shoulders and waist are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部のバイザーは差し替えで上下位置を調整可能。",
      "en": "• The head visor can be replaced and its vertical position adjusted."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• バイザーのクリアパーツ部分は取り外して腰部ジョイントパーツに接続可能。",
      "en": "• The clear part of the visor can be removed and connected to the waist joint part."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 新規造形のエネルギーブレードは鞘から着脱可能。",
      "en": "• The newly shaped energy blade can be attached and removed from the sheath."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 別売りのスピナティアに付属するアーマーを、カスタマイズ可能な胸部パーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with a chest part that allows you to customize the armor that comes with Spinatia (sold separately)."
    }
  ],
